                                "text": "The woman had a sword by her side […] She looked \"very strong and warry and fierce, but not wicked;\" that is, not cruel, at all. The old woman had seen the Irish giant, and \"though he was a fine man, he was nothing to this woman, for he was round, and could not have stepped out so soldierly[…]\""
